      ["Temple Completed", "The Temple is completed and dedicated; Passover is celebrated with the restored community."],
      ["Ezra Arrives", "Ezra receives authority from Artaxerxes to teach the law and administer religious matters in Yehud."],
      ["Ezra's Reform", "Ezra mourns over intermarriage, confesses communal sin and leads a process that requires affected families to separate."]
